{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは٩( ᐛ )و  \n \n 日向坂46の丹生明里(にぶ あかり)です🐸🥕 \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39FG1HKVDZM2VD5XJVXA8K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n にぱーっ！\n \n \n 今回はMステさんの時にたーっくさん写真を撮ったので写真祭りします✨\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39FGZEV1710ZMHMVPQ7HC7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 新衣装だったのですがとっても可愛くて色合いが大好きです！！ソンナコトナイヨにピッタリだなぁって一目見た瞬間に思いました✂️\n \n \n しかもよーく見るとキリトリ線と✂️が生地の柄であるのです！！！！\n その部分をアップで撮り忘れてしまったので今度撮ります！！！！とっても可愛いのです♡\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39FHZE9N59BKQN10SK0JVM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39FJZ84CRS60MJQWKT99D0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n このにぶひよだよ〜ん◡̈\n ポニーツインポニーだ(髪型！)\n シンメトリー感がいいですね笑\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39FM1VTM1X23S3DFJ8V3SC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n つままれたー！😳"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39FN2V3TQ2NY219Q27Y99Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 嬉しいよー！って顔！\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39FP43WQQKT29D0A0N00ND","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 丹生は小坂のニヤケ顔が一番可愛いなぁって思うんです！笑😁\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39FQ4JKARZ0M4NHJHW8M48","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n ひよたんがよく七つの大罪をお勧めしてくれます！アニメみようかなー！笑\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39FR2ZQ8JQQRQVY3Q5QE6J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n じー。\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39FS26EP2C8MZQV7129SJE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n ぴょ！\n \n ぴょこにんみたいだなって思いました！！！！笑\n 🐸🥕\n \n \n \n \n 読んでいただきありがとうございました\n \n #336"}],"source":"archive"}